WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:02.960
<b>Take it back, Kaguya!</b>

00:03.460 --> 00:08.290
<b>I'm sorry, Lion, but I simply don't
see a problem with what I said.</b>

00:08.710 --> 00:11.750
<b>So the needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few?</b>

00:12.040 --> 00:14.540
<b>Is that the kind of "justice" Lady Astrea wants?!</b>

00:19.540 --> 00:22.210
<b>STUPID ELF!</b>

00:22.330 --> 00:22.920
<b>Wha-?</b>

00:23.630 --> 00:26.580
<b>You're so unbelievably naïve,
it makes me want to throw up.</b>

00:27.290 --> 00:31.960
<b>Lady Astrea is an inspiration to me.
I love and respect her very much.</b>

00:32.580 --> 00:37.500
<b>But turning her idea of justice into a reality?
Now that's a different story.</b>

00:38.460 --> 00:42.750
<b>Don't make the mistake of thinking
we have the power to save everyone.</b>

00:42.750 --> 00:46.080
<b>What's the point of peace if
we sacrifice people to obtain it?!</b>

00:46.290 --> 00:48.500
<b>Lion, you're strong.</b>

00:48.920 --> 00:51.380
<b>Strong enough to call my archrival.</b>

00:52.420 --> 00:57.710
<b>But mentally and emotionally,
you're the weakest in the Familia.</b>

00:58.670 --> 01:00.000
<b>Are you trying to insult me?!</b>

01:02.830 --> 01:07.750
<b>Strong and capable warriors.
How many have we lost in the fight against Evilus?</b>

01:08.210 --> 01:11.500
<b>And innocent citizens.
How much of their blood has been shed?</b>

01:12.670 --> 01:16.630
<b>You want to save everyone?
Well, you can't. Dumbass.</b>

01:18.580 --> 01:22.830
<b>The "justice" you like to prattle on about
is nothing more than a convenient ideal.</b>

01:23.750 --> 01:30.290
<b>There comes a time in everyone's life when we're forced
to make a choice. That includes me, and you.</b>

01:31.670 --> 01:35.210
<b>Perhaps you ought to try opening up your eyes...</b>

01:37.040 --> 01:39.330
<b>...and seeing things for what they really are.</b>

01:48.710 --> 01:51.420
<b>But still, I just...</b>

02:02.670 --> 02:06.580
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

03:21.960 --> 03:26.210
<b>White Palace</b>

03:21.960 --> 03:26.210
<b>White Labyrinth</b>

03:27.920 --> 03:30.420
<b>I've lost count of how many we've fought...</b>

03:33.830 --> 03:37.290
<b>Gotta take 'em down fast,
or else they'll overwhelm us again!</b>

03:41.750 --> 03:43.830
<b>It's too late! We're being overrun!</b>

03:44.330 --> 03:45.710
<b>Mr. Cranel, fall back!</b>

03:47.460 --> 03:49.080
<b>Wh-what do we do?</b>

03:49.750 --> 03:52.130
<b>I suppose we have no choice but to use it now.</b>

03:54.210 --> 03:54.920
<b>Shoot!</b>

03:56.210 --> 03:57.500
<b>FIRE BOLT!</b>

04:08.290 --> 04:10.500
<b>Miss Ryu, was that a...?</b>

04:11.170 --> 04:15.170
<b>Yes. A Blazerock that I confiscated from the Dwarf.</b>

04:16.000 --> 04:20.170
<b>An item stolen from Jura's men actually
saved our lives... How's that for irony?</b>

04:20.710 --> 04:22.210
<b>Are there any more left?</b>

04:22.830 --> 04:24.000
<b>Five in total.</b>

04:24.920 --> 04:30.130
<b>Miss Ryu wants us to avoid battle wherever possible,
but the monsters just keep on coming...</b>

04:30.630 --> 04:32.210
<b>Huge groups of them all at once...</b>

04:32.790 --> 04:35.000
<b>Give me just a moment, Mr. Cranel.</b>

04:35.500 --> 04:37.080
<b>I need to update our map.</b>

04:38.210 --> 04:39.380
<b>Keep an eye out for monsters.</b>

04:40.000 --> 04:40.920
<b>Roger.</b>

04:44.380 --> 04:46.170
<b>Wow, you know how to make maps?</b>

04:46.750 --> 04:51.880
<b>Basic ones, yes. A far cry from anything
a professional thief or cartographer could make.</b>

04:54.000 --> 04:57.500
<b>It's always Miss Ryu keeping me safe,
never the other way around.</b>

04:59.130 --> 05:00.130
<b>I'm so weak...</b>

05:02.000 --> 05:05.540
<b>Mr. Cranel, you're wasting too much energy in battle.</b>

05:06.830 --> 05:08.630
<b>You need a more efficient approach.</b>

05:09.330 --> 05:14.040
<b>I know... I know you're right. But I can't do it!</b>

05:14.580 --> 05:16.630
<b>I can't keep going at this rate...</b>

05:16.630 --> 05:18.880
<b>The monsters are too strong and too fast.</b>

05:18.880 --> 05:21.000
<b>The more I panic, the more mistakes I make!</b>

05:22.920 --> 05:24.080
<b>If something doesn't change...</b>

05:26.540 --> 05:27.540
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

05:30.790 --> 05:35.130
<b>Mr. Cranel, you're still nothing like most adventurers.</b>

05:36.710 --> 05:38.380
<b>You're doing a great job.</b>

05:39.420 --> 05:44.750
<b>It's completely normal to get flustered and make
mistakes during your first trip into the Deep Floors.</b>

05:45.630 --> 05:50.920
<b>Any other adventurer would be yelling at me
for making unreasonable demands.</b>

05:51.880 --> 05:53.790
<b>You're being way too hard on yourself.</b>

05:54.250 --> 05:56.880
<b>That's why you're different from other adventurers.</b>

06:00.380 --> 06:06.880
<b>In fact, if you had a little more confidence,
you could be even stronger than you already are.</b>

06:18.170 --> 06:21.040
<b>Pay close attention to the
enemy's movements, study them.</b>

06:21.040 --> 06:23.500
<b>Monsters in the Deep Floors are highly intelligent.</b>

06:24.040 --> 06:27.920
<b>They'll employ more sophisticated tactics than any
of the monsters you've encountered up until now.</b>

06:29.250 --> 06:29.880
<b>Got it.</b>

06:30.540 --> 06:33.540
<b>Your right arm tends to get shaky when you're nervous.</b>

06:34.330 --> 06:37.540
<b>Aim for their magic stones and
try not to tense your shoulder.</b>

06:38.830 --> 06:39.580
<b>Okay.</b>

06:40.500 --> 06:43.250
<b>And let me do some of the heavy lifting from the back.</b>

06:43.880 --> 06:46.380
<b>Because for now, we're a party.</b>

06:47.330 --> 06:47.960
<b>Right!</b>

06:48.670 --> 06:53.000
<b>Do you remember what I taught you before?
Apart from aiming for their magic stones.</b>

06:53.380 --> 06:55.170
<b>"Use my surroundings to my advantage."</b>

06:57.500 --> 07:01.880
<b>Don't forget what I just told you. I know you can do it.</b>

07:05.250 --> 07:08.710
<b>It almost feels like you're my mentor
or something, Miss Ryu.</b>

07:09.670 --> 07:12.630
<b>In another life, maybe I could've been.</b>

07:14.670 --> 07:17.040
<b>Welcome to the 27th Floor, everyone.</b>

07:18.380 --> 07:19.960
<b>We finally made it...</b>

07:19.960 --> 07:21.210
<b>Don't let your guard down!</b>

07:24.500 --> 07:25.630
<b>Monsters incoming!</b>

07:32.080 --> 07:33.880
<b>KAZUKI!</b>

07:41.040 --> 07:42.880
<b>Guess he's got this one covered, too...</b>

07:43.790 --> 07:47.080
<b>Is it just me, or is that thing getting
stronger as time goes on?!</b>

07:48.130 --> 07:54.580
<b>He's been blastin' monsters left and right, and
it still ain't broken! That's some mind-blowin' power...</b>

07:55.790 --> 07:57.500
<b>An indestructible magic sword...</b>

07:57.920 --> 08:00.290
<b>A weapon unlike anything anyone's ever seen...</b>

08:04.420 --> 08:06.040
<b>Hang in there, Ignis!</b>

08:06.420 --> 08:07.380
<b>Yup, I'm good!</b>

08:10.330 --> 08:11.290
<b>Let's keep moving.</b>

08:12.830 --> 08:17.670
<b>Mr. Cranel, are you familiar with the 37th Floor's layout?</b>

08:18.250 --> 08:22.710
<b>If I remember correctly, the Floor's made up
of circular walls called "The Great Rings,"</b>

08:23.540 --> 08:25.960
<b>and it's divided into five different areas.</b>

08:26.330 --> 08:32.790
<b>That's right. The tunnel leading down to the 38th Floor
is located at the heart of the innermost area.</b>

08:33.830 --> 08:38.130
<b>The tunnel leading up to the 36th Floor
is in the outermost area.</b>

08:38.830 --> 08:40.170
<b>Be sure to remember that.</b>

08:40.920 --> 08:44.420
<b>Outermost area... Outermost.</b>

08:45.790 --> 08:47.330
<b>We ought to top off our health.</b>

08:47.670 --> 08:49.000
<b>Oh, good idea.</b>

08:52.380 --> 08:53.210
<b>Drink this.</b>

08:56.170 --> 08:57.750
<b>D-do I really have to...?</b>

08:58.250 --> 09:01.710
<b>This isn't the time to be squeamish. Drink it.</b>

09:03.710 --> 09:04.540
<b>Okay...</b>

09:07.290 --> 09:08.830
<b>Looks pretty old, don'tcha think?</b>

09:08.830 --> 09:11.170
<b>A little mold in a potion isn't going to hurt you.</b>

09:11.790 --> 09:12.790
<b>Miss Ryu...</b>

09:14.630 --> 09:18.290
<b>It should still work just fine... I think.</b>

09:18.460 --> 09:19.460
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

09:42.000 --> 09:43.460
<b>All the pain's gone!</b>

09:44.830 --> 09:46.330
<b>I feel like I can fight again!</b>

09:46.920 --> 09:47.790
<b>Let's get going.</b>

09:48.380 --> 09:48.920
<b>Roger!</b>

10:00.540 --> 10:01.420
<b>Do we make a run for it?</b>

10:01.790 --> 10:03.790
<b>It's too late. We won't get away.</b>

10:04.130 --> 10:05.960
<b>Don't forget what we talked about earlier!</b>

10:05.960 --> 10:06.630
<b>I won't!</b>

10:07.920 --> 10:08.710
<b>Here goes!</b>

10:12.420 --> 10:14.080
<b>TAKE THAT!</b>

10:15.580 --> 10:16.670
<b>MYA-HAH!</b>

10:21.330 --> 10:22.920
<b>EAT THIS!</b>

10:34.580 --> 10:36.920
<b>Look, I'm no expert on the Dungeon, but...</b>

10:37.210 --> 10:39.790
<b>Are things always this noisy down here?</b>

10:40.210 --> 10:42.880
<b>If the monsters were always causing such a big ruckus,</b>

10:43.130 --> 10:46.920
<b>I imagine there would be loads
more dead adventurers lyin' around...</b>

10:46.920 --> 10:49.130
<b>I'm pawsitive it's an Irregular!</b>

10:49.130 --> 10:51.790
<b>I've never seen the Dungeon act so furocious!</b>

10:53.580 --> 10:54.420
<b>What's wrong?</b>

10:55.460 --> 10:58.080
<b>I sense the presence of a terrifying monster.</b>

10:58.580 --> 11:00.880
<b>What? What do you mean?</b>

11:01.330 --> 11:04.000
<b>Call it a feeling... A hunch, I guess.</b>

11:04.000 --> 11:06.630
<b>But it's making the fur on my tail stand up.</b>

11:07.500 --> 11:11.290
<b>It could be on this Floor...
It could be above us or below us...</b>

11:12.130 --> 11:15.210
<b>Either way, there's something uncatural skulking around.</b>

11:29.880 --> 11:32.040
<b>Members of the search party...?</b>

11:32.460 --> 11:36.290
<b>Yeah... That ugly beast made quick work of 'em.</b>

11:38.960 --> 11:41.170
<b>Bell fought a monster that did all this?</b>

11:42.210 --> 11:44.630
<b>But what in the hell is it?</b>

11:47.080 --> 11:48.420
<b>Master Bors.</b>

11:48.580 --> 11:52.080
<b>I'd like you to take us to the area
where you last saw Master Bell.</b>

11:52.170 --> 11:53.500
<b>S-sure thing.</b>

11:58.290 --> 12:00.790
<b>...no... No, don't!</b>

12:00.790 --> 12:02.130
<b>Please, don't go that way!</b>

12:27.330 --> 12:29.750
<b>The monster you saw is called a Peluda.</b>

12:30.500 --> 12:32.460
<b>They infect their prey with a toxic substance.</b>

12:33.170 --> 12:38.460
<b>If I had to guess, the adventurers in that room
probably died as a result of a Peluda's poison quills.</b>

12:40.330 --> 12:43.170
<b>If circumstances allow, it's best to flee altogether.</b>

12:43.880 --> 12:46.750
<b>Are there any other monsters
I should be on the lookout for?</b>

12:47.250 --> 12:48.170
<b>Spartoi.</b>

12:48.750 --> 12:51.040
<b>They're extremely skilled at hand-to-hand combat.</b>

12:51.670 --> 12:53.710
<b>The fact that they're armed
with weapons certainly doesn't help.</b>

12:54.380 --> 12:58.420
<b>"Peludas" and "Spartoi"... I'll be sure to remember that.</b>

13:06.710 --> 13:08.000
<b>Um, Miss Ryu-</b>

13:14.250 --> 13:15.080
<b>What's that?</b>

13:15.580 --> 13:16.380
<b>An Ooze.</b>

13:16.750 --> 13:22.080
<b>They secrete acidic toxins from their mucous
membranes. They vary based on color, but...</b>

13:22.790 --> 13:25.000
<b>...the blue variety are potable.</b>

13:25.250 --> 13:25.920
<b>Huh?!</b>

13:35.250 --> 13:36.130
<b>Drink this.</b>

13:36.670 --> 13:38.420
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

13:38.920 --> 13:41.330
<b>I'm going to drink the other half this time.</b>

13:41.830 --> 13:42.460
<b>Go ahead.</b>

13:52.420 --> 13:54.170
<b>Oh gods, it's disgusting!</b>

13:54.170 --> 13:56.670
<b>It feels like my throat's covered in slimy snot!</b>

13:59.880 --> 14:01.670
<b>H-here you go...</b>

14:01.960 --> 14:03.670
<b>Brace yourself, Miss Ryu...</b>

14:04.210 --> 14:06.540
<b>And I'm sorry for putting my mouth on the flask...</b>

14:10.580 --> 14:11.960
<b>You're not going to drink it?!</b>

14:12.380 --> 14:16.960
<b>I mean, yeah, it's REALLY gross,
but I still drank it! No fair!</b>

14:17.710 --> 14:19.630
<b>You have to drink some, too!</b>

14:20.290 --> 14:24.920
<b>This Floor lacks a water source.
We ought to ration what we have...</b>

14:25.750 --> 14:27.170
<b>I know, but...</b>

14:27.630 --> 14:31.210
<b>I-I almost forgot. You were going
to ask me a question earlier.</b>

14:31.670 --> 14:33.330
<b>Oh, um...</b>

14:34.630 --> 14:37.080
<b>Adventurers who go exploring in the Deep Floors...</b>

14:37.380 --> 14:41.210
<b>I was just wondering if there were
any other two-man parties like us.</b>

14:42.080 --> 14:43.330
<b>I highly doubt it.</b>

14:43.830 --> 14:47.130
<b>At minimum, you'd want a group of three- no, four.</b>

14:47.540 --> 14:50.500
<b>And ideally, you'd want at least one healer.</b>

14:53.420 --> 14:55.460
<b>That's how dangerous it is down here.</b>

15:00.630 --> 15:02.170
<b>There's nobody here...</b>

15:03.000 --> 15:06.750
<b>I watched my men die.
How can their corpses just up and vanish?</b>

15:07.460 --> 15:08.790
<b>What the hell's going on?!</b>

15:09.420 --> 15:12.130
<b>Where did Bell Cranel and Gale Wind go?</b>

15:12.460 --> 15:14.380
<b>There has to be a clue somewhere. Let's look around.</b>

15:22.920 --> 15:25.000
<b>This room's in even worse shape than the last.</b>

15:25.540 --> 15:27.330
<b>Must've been one hell of a battle...</b>

15:30.580 --> 15:31.500
<b>This wall...</b>

15:32.500 --> 15:33.790
<b>One of the Rings?</b>

15:35.420 --> 15:38.290
<b>Yes, I'm sure of it. It's the Third Ring.</b>

15:40.170 --> 15:44.830
<b>There are five Rings in total, but...
each of the Rings have a slightly different hue.</b>

15:45.710 --> 15:49.500
<b>Only the Third Ring, located halfway into the Floor, is
chalk white.</b>

15:50.960 --> 15:54.250
<b>It's hard to see, but the wall appears to curve inwards.</b>

15:56.210 --> 15:57.420
<b>Then that means...!</b>

15:57.420 --> 16:02.130
<b>Precisely. We're standing on
the inner side of the Third Ring.</b>

16:04.080 --> 16:09.040
<b>Now that we know which area we're in, we can figure out
which direction will lead us to the outer exit.</b>

16:09.460 --> 16:10.380
<b>Right!</b>

16:10.710 --> 16:14.500
<b>We're making progress!
We're actually starting to get somewhere!</b>

16:15.540 --> 16:16.500
<b>Let's keep going!</b>

16:18.380 --> 16:22.080
<b>We're going to survive.
And then we'll make it back to the surface!</b>

16:22.920 --> 16:23.880
<b>Together!</b>

16:28.290 --> 16:29.670
<b>But what could've...?</b>

16:31.080 --> 16:32.290
<b>That's a big hole...</b>

16:33.290 --> 16:35.040
<b>If it was the Lambton...</b>

16:43.790 --> 16:46.080
<b>Master Bell might be down there...</b>

16:46.580 --> 16:47.580
<b>You're kiddin' me!</b>

16:48.420 --> 16:51.960
<b>Wait a minute... He might be
even farther down than we thought?!</b>

16:52.420 --> 16:54.080
<b>We don't have definitive proof...</b>

16:54.790 --> 16:59.210
<b>But the one thing we do know for sure
is that Master Bell isn't here. So let's keep-</b>

17:03.290 --> 17:04.500
<b>Voltimeria!</b>

17:08.420 --> 17:10.000
<b>Is that from the...?</b>

17:11.500 --> 17:14.170
<b>So YOU'RE the bastards who ate my men!</b>

17:20.000 --> 17:23.380
<b>These things have an insane amount of durability!
Don't try to challenge them head-on!</b>

17:23.380 --> 17:24.830
<b>Make a break for the exit!</b>

17:28.880 --> 17:29.580
<b>We're trapped!</b>

17:38.420 --> 17:39.960
<b>They just keep on comin'!</b>

17:41.830 --> 17:44.080
<b>Finally, the 27th Floor, meow!</b>

17:44.710 --> 17:47.630
<b>Ryu! Where are you, Ryu?!</b>

17:48.000 --> 17:51.250
<b>RYU?! RYU!</b>

17:51.250 --> 17:52.920
<b>Shut up, stupid cat!</b>

17:51.500 --> 17:54.000
<b>RYU?! HEY, RYU!</b>

17:56.330 --> 17:57.040
<b>More monsters?!</b>

18:03.420 --> 18:04.710
<b>They left, meow...</b>

18:05.790 --> 18:09.040
<b>Something doesn't feel right... We need to hurry.</b>

18:11.710 --> 18:13.250
<b>Th-there are too many!</b>

18:13.670 --> 18:15.500
<b>They're blocking our escape...</b>

18:16.000 --> 18:17.080
<b>Is there another exit?!</b>

18:17.500 --> 18:19.830
<b>No, that tunnel's the only way forward!</b>

18:20.290 --> 18:21.080
<b>Here goes!</b>

18:21.210 --> 18:23.330
<b>OUTTA THE WAY!</b>

18:26.250 --> 18:28.130
<b>It's my turn! DIE, FISHFACE!</b>

18:32.000 --> 18:33.130
<b>TAKE THAT!</b>

18:35.830 --> 18:38.580
<b>Shit... SHIT!</b>

18:45.380 --> 18:46.250
<b>Meow?!</b>

18:46.830 --> 18:48.540
<b>What the hell happened here?!</b>

18:49.380 --> 18:54.880
<b>I've never seen anything like it... We might be lookin' at
the handiwork of that thing you mentioned earlier.</b>

18:57.130 --> 18:58.250
<b>I hear voices.</b>

18:59.380 --> 19:00.170
<b>Meown there!</b>

19:00.540 --> 19:02.080
<b>YOU SONS OF BITCHES!</b>

19:05.750 --> 19:07.420
<b>Stubborn bastards, aren't they?!</b>

19:07.920 --> 19:11.250
<b>If this keeps up, we're gonna run out
of energy way before they do!</b>

19:11.920 --> 19:15.130
<b>Every second we're stuck here
is a waste of precious time...</b>

19:33.540 --> 19:34.460
<b>He's reached his limit...</b>

19:40.420 --> 19:44.460
<b>Should we fall back? No, we can't afford to lose ground...</b>

19:50.250 --> 19:51.330
<b>You can't be serious!</b>

19:51.500 --> 19:52.460
<b>Even more?!</b>

19:53.000 --> 19:54.710
<b>Is this the end of the line...?</b>

19:56.380 --> 19:57.380
<b>Lady Cassandra!</b>

19:57.380 --> 19:58.330
<b>Cassandra!</b>

20:16.580 --> 20:17.130
<b>Huh?</b>

20:27.380 --> 20:28.670
<b>They're fighting each other...?</b>

20:28.670 --> 20:30.210
<b>What the hell's going on here?!</b>

20:32.290 --> 20:34.330
<b>Wait, could it really be...?</b>

20:37.210 --> 20:38.290
<b>The Xenos!</b>

20:44.080 --> 20:46.250
<b>Hello again, my surface-dwelling friends!</b>

20:46.580 --> 20:47.830
<b>How'd you know we were here?</b>

20:48.330 --> 20:51.330
<b>Fels told us. Thank goodness we made it in time!</b>

20:51.960 --> 20:58.960
<b>We made Mr. Bell a promise: "The next time you and your
friends are in trouble, we'll come running to the rescue!"</b>

21:05.080 --> 21:09.630
<b>How much can I help him grow before I disappear?</b>

21:11.080 --> 21:17.500
<b>Expecting to sacrifice myself right off the bat is
a terrible plan, but... I need to be prepared for the worst.</b>

21:19.000 --> 21:24.460
<b>Something tells me the Deep Floors won't be kind
enough to let us both escape with our lives.</b>

21:26.210 --> 21:29.960
<b>And eventually, the time will come
when a sacrifice has to be made.</b>

21:31.830 --> 21:38.210
<b>Even now, Mr. Cranel is chasing after his ideal outcome.
A future where he and I survive.</b>

21:39.330 --> 21:45.420
<b>Did I used to go chasing after ideals with that same
heartfelt look in my eyes all those years ago...?</b>

21:50.500 --> 21:57.040
<b>There comes a time in everyone's life when we're forced
to make a choice. That includes me, and you.</b>

21:58.670 --> 22:04.170
<b>You should be happy, Kaguya.
It looks like I'm on your side now.</b>

